{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅れてごめんなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/10/5741961/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅れちゃったけど4thシングルの選抜発表。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は八福神に選んでいただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直、すごい人気があるわけではないし、ダンスとか歌が特別上手なわけじゃないし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな自分がフロントメンバーでいいのかな?、ファンの方もそう思ってるのかな?とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろ思うことがありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも握手会やお手紙、ブログのコメントとかでファンのみんながたくさんいろんな言葉をかけてくれて、みなみがこんなじゃダメだなぁーって(*^^*)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからはちょっとずつだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自信とか、自分のいいとことかを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みつけるの頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/10/5741961/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/10/5741961/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも応援ありがとうございます(><)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなつー(*^o^*)♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかえりー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/10/5741961/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いきなり八福神でびっくりで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不安いーっぱいあるかもしれないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかあったらみなみにいってね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみ頼りないから聞くことないｗｗかな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなつ、天然でめっちゃかわいい(><)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すきーだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/10/5741961/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/10/5741961/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/10/5741961/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は学校で始業式だったよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/10/5741961/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"制服にハーフアップ∩ω∩♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勉強できそーでしょ(´ー`)ｗ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度まなつとの写メのせまーす♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいばーい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/10/5741961/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/10/5741961/0003.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}